# Trivy Security Scan Ignore File
# 
# Format: CVE-ID or misconfig ID with justification comment above
# Only add entries for false positives or accepted risks with clear justification

# AVD-AWS-0031 (HIGH): ECR repository image tag mutability set to MUTABLE
# Demo environment: Mutable tags allow iterative development and testing without
# creating unique tags for every build. Production deployments should use IMMUTABLE.
AVD-AWS-0031

# AVD-AWS-0104 (CRITICAL): Security group rule allows unrestricted egress
# Demo environment: ECS tasks require unrestricted egress to connect to Confluent
# Cloud endpoints which span multiple AWS regions and use dynamic IPs. Production
# deployments should use VPC PrivateLink or restrict to known CIDR ranges.
AVD-AWS-0104

# AVD-AWS-0164 (HIGH): Subnet associates public IP address
# Demo environment: Public subnets with auto-assigned IPs are required for AWS
# Fargate tasks that need both inbound (for metrics/health checks) and outbound
# (Confluent Cloud) connectivity. Production should use private subnets with NAT Gateway.
AVD-AWS-0164
